{"id":"acostumbrado","lemma":"acostumbrado","pos":"adj","rank":2568,"glosses":["customary","accustomed to, used to"],"ipa":"/akostumˈbɾado/","forms":{"feminine":"acostumbrada","masculinePlural":"acostumbrados","femininePlural":"acostumbradas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-acostumbrado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Está acostumbrado a trabajar duro.","en":"He is used to hard work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639427","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"hard"}]},{"text":"La gente aquí está acostumbrada al frío.","en":"The people here are used to the cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704693","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"cold"}]},{"text":"Estoy acostumbrado al ruido.","en":"I'm used to the noise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38510","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"noise"}]},{"text":"Ellos están acostumbrados al trabajo duro.","en":"They are accustomed to hard work.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"hard"}]},{"text":"La niña está acostumbrada a jugar sola.","en":"The girl is used to playing all by herself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693580","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"sole","l":"solo"}]}]}